{%- comment -%}
  Add-to-cart button text by product kind (classes keep registration wording), so the button reads like a ski school
  rather than a shop:
    Bus (product type)            -> 预订座位 / Reserve seat
    Membership (product type)     -> 加入会员 / Join now
    in the "shopping" collection  -> 加入购物车 / Add to cart   (gear store)
    everything else               -> 加入报名清单 / Add to registration (lessons, camps, trips)

  Usage: {%- render 'add-to-cart-label', product: product -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign label_key = 'products.product.add_to_registration'
  if product.type == 'Bus'
    assign label_key = 'products.product.reserve_seat'
  elsif product.type == 'Membership'
    assign label_key = 'products.product.join_membership'
  else
    for collection in product.collections
      if collection.handle == 'shopping'
        assign label_key = 'products.product.add_to_cart'
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  echo label_key | t
-%}
